Package: libconfluent-kafka0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Confluent Kafka client - C library
 The Apache Kafka client of Confluent, written in Rust: producer, consumer
 and admin client behind a C API.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libconfluent-kafka-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libconfluent-kafka0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Confluent Kafka client - C development files
 The Apache Kafka client of Confluent, written in Rust: producer, consumer
 and admin client behind a C API.
 .
 This package contains the C headers, the static library and the pkg-config
 file.

Package: libconfluent-kafka-cpp0.1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Confluent Kafka client - C++ library
 The C++ binding of Confluent's Apache Kafka client, over its C library,
 with the API of the Java client.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libconfluent-kafka-cpp-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libconfluent-kafka-cpp0.1 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libconfluent-kafka-dev (>= ${core:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Confluent Kafka client - C++ development files
 The C++ binding of Confluent's Apache Kafka client, over its C library,
 with the API of the Java client.
 .
 This package contains the C++ headers, the static library, the CMake
